      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "When the Rabble Mawb has marked half or more of its HP, its standard attack deals 1d4+1 physical damage instead."
    },
    {
      "name": "Come Back Worse",
      "kind": "Reaction",
      "rulesText": "When the Rabble Mawb is defeated, you can spend a Fear to bring it back to life, clearing all HP and Stress. The Rabble Mawb gains a bonus to all rolls equal to the number of times this feature has been used by this Rabble Mawb."
